      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OORAH (8) is a sprinter who excels over the short dashes. Was in the money last time (23.96) over 407m at Rockhampton in a Mix 5 but is better suited by this sharper distance. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of five tries. The form from his last run stacks up well. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. WHITNEY GIRL (2) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (22.40) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Key runner on best form. TOBIAS IVY (1) showed a good performance to score by 0.8 lengths at this track over 380m (22.39) in a Grade 6. Leading chance again. ASHY BEAR (3) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
